  "text": "Animal Hospital in Vienna, VA - Hope Advanced Veterinary Center\nOpen Menu\nClose Menu\nAbout\nOur Specialty Hospital\nWhy Trust Us?\nOur Emergency Vets\nOur Specialists\nFinancing Options\nAffiliations & Partnerships\nInternships & Externships\nNews & Stories\n24/7 Emergency\nSpecialty Services\nOncology\nInternal Medicine\nOphthalmology\nCardiology\nSurgery\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nIn-House Lab\nReferrals\nCareers\nContact\nSearch\nSearch\nFacebook\nInstagram\n×\nClose\nSearch\nSearch\nSkip to Main Content\nAccessible Version\nStandard Version\nFacebook\nInstagram\n140 Park St SE\nVienna\nVA\n22180\nUS\n(703) 281-5121\n(703) 281-0149\nShop\nAbout\nOur Specialty Hospital\nWhy Trust Us?\nOur Emergency Vets\nOur Specialists\nFinancing Options\nAffiliations & Partnerships\nInternships & Externships\nNews & Stories\n24/7 Emergency\nSpecialty Services\nOncology\nInternal Medicine\nOphthalmology\nCardiology\nSurgery\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nIn-House Lab\nReferrals\nCareers\nContact\nOpen Search Dialog\nOPEN 7 DAYS A WEEK INCLUDING SATURDAYS & SUNDAYS\nOpen 7 Days a Week in Vienna\nAt\nHope Advanced Veterinary Center\n, we provide specialty veterinary services, as well as\n24-hour emergency care 7 days a week\n, including\nSaturdays and Sundays.\nCall\n(703) 281-5121\nOpen 7 Days a Week in Vienna\nAt\nHope Advanced Veterinary Center\n, we provide specialty veterinary services, as well as\n24-hour emergency care 7 days a week\n, including\nSaturdays and Sundays.\nCall\n(703) 281-5121\nOncology\nProviding cutting-edge diagnostics and treatments to pets with cancer.\nLearn More\nInternal Medicine\nTaking a comprehensive, team-based approach for pets with illnesses.\nLearn More\nOphthalmology\nDiagnosing and treating eye disorders and diseases in cats and dogs.\nLearn More\nSpecialists\nOur board-certified specialists provide compassionate care to your pet.\nLearn More\nYour Trusted Source for Specialty Care\nHope Advanced Veterinary Center Welcomes Patients 7 Days A Week\nOur veterinarians offer comprehensive specialized medical services for cats and dogs in Vienna and the surrounding areas.\nFrom\noncology\n,\nophthalmology\nand\nsurgery\nto\ndiagnostics\n, we are Vienna's trusted source for specialty care, and partner with a number of care providers.\nWe care for animals from across Northern Virginia, Washington DC and Maryland, and have built a reputation over the years for quality, professional care with a compassionate touch.\nOur team of experienced vets in Vienna are proud to live up to the standards of veterinary excellence laid out by the American Animal Hospital Association!\nAbout Our Hospital\nQuality, Integrity, Compassion & Service\nHope Advanced Veterinary Center\nis a full-service animal hospital that offers comprehensive specialty veterinary services for pets in Vienna. From oncology to internal medicine and diagnostics, we've got all the services you need for your pet under one roof.\n24/7 Emergency\nVeterinarians trained to provide quality, compassionate emergency medical care.\nLearn More\nInternal Medicine\nProviding advanced care and internal medicine services for sick pets.\nLearn More\nOncology\nProviding cutting-edge diagnostics and treatments to pets with cancer.\nLearn More\nOphthalmology\nBoard-certified veterinary ophthalmologist specializing in treating eye diseases.\nLearn More\nCardiology\nBoard-certified veterinary cardiologists treating cardiovascular disease in animals.\nLearn More\nSurgery\nBoard-certified veterinary surgeons performing a range of advanced surgeries.\nLearn More\nAccreditations & Certifications\nWhat Our Clients Are Saying\nThey are worth their services to help our family and our aging dog of 16. To give us a little more time with her. They helped us understand what’s going on with her and what we need to do for her. Thank y’all so much.\n- Chris C.\nTips & Advice From Vienna Vets\nWhether you are looking for advice about serious symptoms and conditions or which household products are toxic to pets, our informative blogs feature valuable tips and advice from our Vienna vets that will help you to keep your pets healthy and happy.\nWe've Been Named Some of Northern Virginia Magazine Top Veterinarians for 2026!\nFive Hope Advanced Veterinary Center veterinarians have been named 2026 Top Veterinarians by Northern Virginia Magazine. Join us in congratulating Drs. McNeill, Adkins, Gisselman, Mason, and Caro on this well-deserved recognition.\nRead more\nNational Service Dog Eye Examination Month\nEvery May, Hope Advanced Veterinary Center is proud to participate in National Service Dog Eye Examination Month, a meaningful initiative dedicated to supporting the health and well-being of service and working dogs.\nRead more\nEngaging with Our Community at Viva Vienna\nThe Hope Advanced Veterinary Center team wasn't about to let a little bad weather stand in the way of meeting plenty of local furry friends and having a fantastic time at the 2026 Viva Vienna Event.\nRead more\nNew Patients Welcome\nHope Advanced Veterinary Center\nis always accepting new patients! Our board-certified vets and specialists are passionate about restoring good health to Vienna's pets.\nContact Us\nOpen 7 Days a Week Including Saturday & Sunday\nHope Advanced Veterinary Center\nproudly serves patients in Vienna and beyond.\nEmergency Hours\nMonday:\n24 hours\nTuesday:\n24 hours\nWednesday:\n24 hours\nThursday:\n24 hours\nFriday:\n24 hours\nSaturday:\n24 hours\nSunday:\n24 hours\nOther Department Hours\nEach of our\nspecialty departments\nkeeps unique hours.\nAddress\n140 Park St SE\nVienna\nVA\n22180\nUS\nPhone\n(703) 281-5121\nHome\nAbout\n24/7 Emergency\nSpecialty Services\nIn-House Lab\nReferrals\nCareers\nHope Advanced Veterinary Center\n140 Park St SE\nVienna\nVA\n22180\nUS\nPrivacy Policy\nDo Not Sell or Share My Personal Information\nTerms & Conditions\nAccessibility\nSitemap\nSearch\nFacebook\nInstagram\nCopyright © 2026. All Rights Reserved.\nPart of the\nPetVet Care Centers Network\n.\nContact\n(703) 281-5121\nOpen Menu\nClose Menu",
